    ('p', '<b>Khadi</b> is hand-spun and hand-woven, with a gentle irregular texture. <b>Chanderi</b> and <b>Kota doria</b> are fine and airy, ideal for summer kurtas and dupattas. <b>Jamdani</b> adds motifs inlaid by hand into fine muslin.'),
